        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Building on years of experience with a singular focus on addressing connectivity challenges in data-centric systems, we have developed and deployed our leading Intelligent Connectivity Platform built from the ground up for cloud and AI infrastructure.",
